Modifications: rewritten in the house style. Engine API and version-specific
profiler details (Godot monitor constants, Unity and Unreal code) were removed
or reduced to short pointers, with Godot specifics deferred to the godot
skill. Added: classification of cost before fixing (GPU, scripts, physics,
render submission, memory and GC, loading), percentile frame times, a hitch
section (shader compilation, main-thread loading, first-use instantiation,
frame pacing), the distinction between garbage-collected and
reference-counted runtimes, resolution and toggle discriminators, profiler
overhead and vsync caveats, and a regression-check recipe.

